 "why": [
  "Lucky Seven hits from range, so you clear mobs on the next platform from where you stand. Less walking, less touch damage and fewer pots, from 10 until you switch.",
  "Bandit SP does nothing for a claw, so every point from 30 goes toward the dagger. Dagger Mastery 5 and Booster 1 first, then Savage Blow 21 by 39, ready for the switch at 40.",
  "At 21 Savage Blow hits 6 times for 65%, so 390% a cast against 280% for a maxed Lucky Seven. On our training engine the Korean Fan at 40 does about 1,235 damage a second against 838 with the claw, and about 86K EXP an hour against 64K. It doesn't count walking to mobs yet, so it hasn't been timed in game.",
  "Korean Fan needs no DEX, so the switch costs you no AP. Your next DEX is at 47 to 49, for Shinkita at 50.",
  "Reset your 1st job SP the day you switch. Lucky Seven and Keen Eyes are 35 dead points once you hold a dagger. Moved into Double Stab 20 and Dark Sight 20, our engine has you at about 86K EXP an hour at 40 instead of 81K without the reset, because Double Stab finishes some mobs faster."
 ],
 "mistakes": [
  "Picking up a dagger at 35. You'd only have Savage Blow 10 and Mastery 5, about the same damage as Lucky Seven (707 vs 750 a second), and now you're walking into every mob. Stay on the claw until Savage Blow is 21.",
  "Putting SP in Haste right after the 2nd job advance. Haste 20 is 20 SP, close to 7 levels, and pushes your switch back by that much. Do it after the dagger skills.",
  "Putting more than 1 point in Dagger Booster before Savage Blow is 21. Level 1 is already the full speed boost; the other 19 points only stretch it from 100 to 300 seconds. That's over 6 levels of SP that should be in Savage Blow.",
  "Forgetting DEX before 50. Shinkita needs 45 DEX, so put 47 to 49 into DEX or you hit 50 and can't wear it. Same at 58 to 59 for Deadly Fin and 68 to 69 for Kandine.",
  "Switching to the dagger without the SP Reset. You'll never throw Lucky Seven again, so those 35 points in Lucky Seven and Keen Eyes do nothing. Reset at 40 and put them into Double Stab 20, Nimble Body 15, Disorder 6 and Dark Sight 20."
 ],
